%% docs/sequence-diagram-v2.mermaid
%% rem2 时序图（配合 docs/01-architecture-overview.md §3 / §6，前端链路见 docs/03-frontend-ipc.md）
%% 5 条主链路：启动 / 命令 / 事件 / 配置 / 卸载 + Svelte 面板订阅

%% ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
%% 链路 ① 启动：逻辑 7 段状态机 × 物理执行管线
%%   物理步骤：1 发现 → 2 解析 → 3 加载 → 4 配置 → 5 Start
%%   注意 ★ 标记处：依赖解析在物理上早于加载
%% ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant EM as ElectronMain<br/>(host/electron)
    participant K as Kernel
    participant CFG as ConfigService
    participant DISC as PluginDiscovery
    participant RES as DependencyResolver
    participant EP as ExtensionPointRegistry
    participant LD as PluginLoader
    participant PIPE as LifecyclePipeline
    participant PL as 插件 hello-command

    EM->>K: new Kernel(options)
    Note over K: 由 Composition.createDeps() 注入 14 个服务<br/>Kernel 构造器不再 new 具体实现
    EM->>K: start()

    rect rgb(232,244,248)
    Note over CFG: 物理第 0 步：配置快照必须先于任何插件 onConfigure
    K->>CFG: refresh()
    CFG->>CFG: 按 priority 串行 load() 每个 provider → deepMerge → snapshot
    end

    rect rgb(232,244,248)
    Note over DISC: 物理步骤 1：发现
    K->>DISC: discoverDetailed({roots, builtinRoot, workspaceRoot})
    DISC->>DISC: 扫描目录 → 读 plugin.json → validateManifest
    DISC->>DISC: ★ entry 校验：只允许 .js / .mjs
    DISC-->>K: candidates[] (state=Registered) + issues[]
    end

    rect rgb(255,243,205)
    Note over RES: 物理步骤 2：解析
    K->>RES: resolve(candidates, kernelVersion, contractVersion)
    RES->>RES: 去重 → 兼容性 → 硬/软依赖 → propagateDrops → 环检测 → 确定性拓扑排序
    RES-->>K: plan{loadOrder, steps, issues, dropped}
    Note over K: 每个候选标记为 Resolved；<br/>被丢弃者标记 Dropped 且不再加载
    end

    rect rgb(255,243,205)
    Note over EP: 宿主在启动前注册默认实现（ui.theme / log.sink / scheduler.replace …）
    K->>EP: registerHostDefault(...) × N
    EP-->>K: ok（冲突按 def.conflict 裁决并记 issue）
    end

    loop 对 plan.loadOrder 中每个 pluginId
        K->>K: permissions.check(manifest, trustLevelFor(source))
        Note over K: 物理步骤 3：加载
        K->>LD: load(candidate, loadOptions)
        LD->>LD: resolveEntry(rootDir, 'dist/index.js')
        LD->>LD: await import(fileURL) → 断言 mod.default 是函数
        LD->>LD: ★ 校验 definePlugin 首参 .id 与 manifest.id 一致
        LD->>LD: rootContainer.createChild('plugin:<id>')
        LD->>LD: createPluginContext(...) → 注入 ExtensionContributorView
        LD-->>K: LoadedPlugin (state=Loaded)

        Note over PIPE: 逻辑④初始化
        K->>PIPE: runStart(instance, ctx, missingOptional)
        PIPE->>PL: onDiscover() → onLoad()
        Note over PIPE: 物理步骤 4：配置（运行期早于启动）
        PIPE->>PL: onConfigure(ctx) —— ctx.config 直读 snapshot
        PL->>EP: ctx.extensions.contribute('command.provide', {contributionId:'hello', impl})
        EP-->>PL: ok（若 capability 未授予 → CapabilityDeniedError → Failed）

        Note over PIPE: 物理步骤 5：Start
        PIPE->>PL: onStart()
        PL-->>PIPE: void
        PIPE-->>K: LifecycleOutcome{ok, degraded, rolledBack}
        K->>K: applyPluginState(Active | Degraded | Failed) + setHealth + emit(plugin.state-changed)
    end

    K-->>EM: KernelStartResult{loadOrder, started, degraded, failed}
    EM->>K: health()
    K-->>EM: HealthReport

%% ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
%% 链路 ② 命令：renderer → preload → ipcMain → 白名单 → 内核 CommandDispatcher → command.provide 槽
%%   单一分发路径：插件贡献 command.provide，dispatcher 按 contributionId 查槽并原样返回；
%%   插件不要再直接 respond command.execute（start() 注册的 dispatcher 按 seq 确定性遮蔽）
%% ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant S as Shell.svelte
    participant IC as IpcClient
    participant PL as preload.ts
    participant IM as ipcMain
    participant BR as IpcBridge
    participant CH as IpcChannels
    participant EB as EventBusImpl
    participant CD as CommandDispatcher（内核）
    participant EP as ExtensionPointRegistry
    participant HP as hello-command

    S->>IC: execute('hello', {name:'rem2'})
    IC->>PL: window.rem2.invoke('command.execute', {command, args})
    PL->>IM: send('rem2:invoke', {id, method, args})
    IM->>BR: transport.on('rem2:invoke')
    BR->>CH: isAllowed('command.execute')
    alt 不在白名单
        CH-->>BR: false
        BR-->>PL: {id, ok:false, error:'方法不在 IPC 契约面内'}
        PL-->>IC: reject
        IC-->>S: Error
    else 在白名单内
        CH-->>BR: true
        BR->>EB: request('command.execute', args, {timeoutMs:5000})
        EB->>CD: dispatch(payload)（start() 注册的唯一 responder）
        CD->>EP: entries('command.provide') 按 contributionId === command 查找
        EP-->>CD: entry.impl（未命中 → {ok:false, error:'unknown command: …'}）
        CD->>HP: impl(args)
        HP-->>CD: {ok, output}（原样返回，不再包装）
        CD-->>EB: result
        EB-->>BR: result
        BR-->>PL: {id, ok:true, result}
        PL-->>IC: resolve
        IC-->>S: result 写入 runes store
    end

%% ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
%% 链路 ③ 事件派发：桶索引 + 订阅期定序 + 错误隔离
%% ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P1 as 插件 A
    participant EB as EventBusImpl
    participant H1 as 订阅者 1（priority 10）
    participant H2 as 订阅者 2（priority 0）
    participant M as MetricsService

    P1->>EB: emit('plugin.state-changed', payload)
    EB->>EB: buckets.get('plugin') ★ O(桶大小)，不再全表 filter+sort
    EB->>EB: 快照内按 priority/seq 有序（订阅期已定序，此处不再 sort）
    loop 快照内串行 await
        EB->>H1: handler(payload)
        H1-->>EB: ok
        EB->>H2: handler(payload)
        H2--xEB: throw
        EB->>EB: errors.push(...)  ★ 错误隔离，不影响其他订阅者
        EB->>M: counter('event_handler_error').add(1)
    end
    EB-->>P1: 返回（不抛）

%% ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
%% 链路 ④ 配置：provider 分层 + 变更推送 + Worker 快照同步
%% ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant PJ as 插件 config-json
    participant CFG as ConfigService
    participant P1 as 插件 onConfigure
    participant WK as Worker 插件

    P1->>CFG: registerProvider(jsonProvider, priority=100)
    CFG->>CFG: 按 priority 升序排序 + dirty=true
    CFG->>CFG: 订阅 provider.onDidChange → dirty=true + emitChange
    CFG->>CFG: refresh() ★ 串行 await 每个 provider → deepMerge → snapshot

    P1->>CFG: ctx.config.get('health.http.port', 0)
    Note over CFG: ★ dirty=true 时惰性 refresh（修复 O18）

    CFG->>WK: onDidChange → postMessage({t:'config', snapshot})
    Note over WK: Worker 覆盖整个快照<br/>（onDidChange 在 Worker 侧返回空函数）

    P1->>CFG: await set('feature.x', v)
    CFG->>CFG: 最高可写 provider.set(key, value)
    CFG->>CFG: ★ 仅增量合并受影响路径（修复 O19），不再全量 refresh
    CFG->>CFG: emitChange(['feature.x'], 'feature.x')
    CFG->>WK: postMessage({t:'config', snapshot})

%% ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
%% 链路 ⑤ 卸载：依赖者先卸载 + 内核强制回收
%% ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant EM as ElectronMain
    participant K as Kernel
    participant REG as PluginsRegistry
    participant PIPE as LifecyclePipeline
    participant EP as ExtensionPointRegistry
    participant PM as PermissionManager
    participant HS as HealthService
    participant RC as rootContainer
    participant DEP as 依赖者插件

    EM->>K: unloadPlugin('com.rem2.config-json', 'user-disable')
    K->>REG: allLoaded().filter(硬依赖本插件)
    loop 递归（依赖者先停）
        K->>K: unloadPlugin(依赖者, 'dependency-failed')
        K->>PIPE: runStop(依赖者)
        PIPE->>DEP: onStop → onUnload → onDispose
    end

    K->>PIPE: runStop(instance, ctx, 'user-disable')
    PIPE->>DEP: onStop(ctx, reason)
    DEP->>EP: （若插件未主动 retract，内核也不依赖它）
    PIPE->>DEP: onUnload(ctx)
    PIPE->>DEP: onDispose(ctx)

    Note over K: teardownPluginArtifacts —— P6 强制回收，不依赖插件自觉
    K->>EP: retractAll('com.rem2.config-json') ★ 撤回其全部扩展点贡献
    K->>HS: unregisterCheck(pluginId)
    K->>PM: unregister(pluginId)（含 guard.unregisterPermissions）
    K->>RC: unmountChildContainer(container)
    K->>RC: container.dispose()（级联 dispose 子容器与 disposable 服务）
    K->>K: applyPluginState('Stopped') → emit('kernel.plugin.state-changed')（贡献已回收，无竞态）
    K->>REG: remove(pluginId) + 从 startResult 四个数组剔除
    K->>K: emit('kernel.plugin.unloaded', {pluginId, reason})

%% ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
%% 链路 ⑥ Svelte 前端：面板订阅 + 主题消费（详见 docs/03-frontend-ipc.md）
%% ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant EN as entry-client.ts
    participant AP as App.svelte
    participant SH as Shell.svelte
    participant IC as IpcClient
    participant BR as IpcBridge
    participant EP as ExtensionPointRegistry
    participant TH as ThemeRegistryImpl

    EN->>AP: mount(#app)
    AP->>SH: 渲染布局
    SH->>IC: request('ui.panel.list')
    IC->>BR: invoke('rem2:invoke', {method:'ui.panel.list'})
    BR->>EP: resolve('ui.panel') → readonly PanelContribution[]
    EP-->>BR: 面板声明列表
    BR-->>IC: PanelDto[]
    IC-->>SH: 写入 $state panels
    SH->>SH: PanelHost.svelte 渲染插槽（插件不提供 Svelte 组件，只提供描述）

    SH->>IC: subscribe('ui.theme.changed')
    IC->>BR: 订阅（白名单事件名）
    BR->>TH: on('ui.theme.changed')
    Note over TH: 主题由宿主注册表持有<br/>插件经 ui.theme 扩展点贡献 token

    BR-->>IC: ThemeDto{id, colors, fonts, spacing}
    IC-->>SH: $state theme
    SH->>SH: lib/theme/vars.ts 把 token 映射为 CSS 变量
    SH->>SH: document.documentElement.style.setProperty('--color-bg', …)
    Note over SH: CSP style-src 含 'unsafe-inline' → CSSOM 写入可行<br/>（不需 unsafe-eval）

    SH->>IC: report('ui.event', {panelId, kind:'click'})
    IC->>BR: invoke('ui.event')
    BR->>EP: 路由到对应面板的 command
    Note over BR: ★ renderer 不能任意 request 内核主题或配置<br/>只能走 shared/ipc-contract.ts 白名单